15. Bitwarden browser extension — src/data/extensions/ (SHIPPED)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

`bitwarden-2026.9.3.zip` is the official Chrome-channel build of the
Bitwarden Password Manager web extension, release `browser-v2026.9.3`,
repacked without source maps. It is installed once per profile as a
default bundled extension (disabled unless the profile had no prior
extensions, never in off-the-record or Tor profiles) and appears in
the Extensions settings panel like any other add-on, where it can be
disabled or uninstalled. The extension is GPL-3.0-only; the upstream
license texts are vendored beside the archive as
`bitwarden-LICENSE.txt` and `bitwarden-LICENSE_GPL.txt`, and
src/data/extensions/PROVENANCE.txt records the download URL and
SHA-256 checksums. Source: github.com/bitwarden/clients. Bitwarden is
a trademark of Bitwarden Inc.; bundling does not imply endorsement.

