16. Servo embedding spike — spikes/servo (experimental, NOT shipped)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

spikes/servo builds a thin C ABI over libservo (git-pinned servo v0.7.0)
plus a Qt harness. It is not part of the qmake build and nothing from
it ships in released binaries; it exists to validate a future
alternate-engine backend.

