tree (including mozjs/SpiderMonkey, WebRender and bundled fonts) is
gated by spikes/servo/servo-embed/deny.toml, which allowlists MIT,
Apache-2.0 (incl. WITH LLVM-exception), BSD-2/3-Clause, BSL-1.0,
CC0-1.0, CDLA-Permissive-2.0, ISC, MPL-2.0, OFL-1.1, OpenSSL,
Ubuntu-font-1.0, Unicode-3.0, Unicode-DFS-2016, Zlib and
GPL-2.0-or-later. Full lockfile: spikes/servo/servo-embed/Cargo.lock.

